vukery: code brought in from the Mission Pinball Framework (MPF)

Some files in vukery are copied from, or substantially derived from, the
Mission Pinball Framework: https://github.com/missionpinball/mpf

How imports work:
  * Code is fetched from GitHub at one pinned commit, never from a local
    install.
  * Each copied file or block starts with a comment holding a permalink to
    its exact origin.
  * The verbatim copy is committed on its own ("import(mpf): ...") before
    any change. To see how vukery's version differs from MPF's:
        git log --diff-filter=A --format=%H -- <vukery path>   # import commit
        git diff <import commit>..HEAD -- <vukery path>
  * scripts/import_mpf.py does all of this and appends an entry below.

